‘So much worse than people realize’: Images, troops reveal damage at US bases

Never-before-published photos and videos have confirmed damage to US military facilities across West Asia during Iran’s retaliatory attacks, with US military personnel slamming their country for mismanagement and inadequate preparations and for “abandoning” them during the recent war on Iran.

